          }
        ]
      },
      "worked": "From the conditional probability definition,\n$$\\begin{align*}P(B\\mid A)&=\\frac{P(A\\cap B)}{P(A)}\\\\P(A\\cap B)&=P(A)P(B\\mid A).\\end{align*}$$\nSubstitute into the definition of $P(A\\mid B)$:\n$$\\begin{align*}P(A\\mid B)&=\\frac{P(A\\cap B)}{P(B)}\\\\P(A\\mid B)&=\\frac{P(A)P(B\\mid A)}{P(B)}.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
